<title>NETHERLANDS: Table - Ahrend H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Table - Ahrend H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    per shr (guilders)		   1.77 vs   1.58</p>
<p>    Net profit			    27.6  vs  24.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected Ahrend to report a net profit from ordinary operations of 27 million to 30 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Turnover			     385.6  vs 370.3</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    41.3  vs  36.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     13.3  vs  11.8</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
